<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan stocks end 2.36 pct down, seen bearish.</title>
<headline>Pakistan stocks end 2.36 pct down, seen bearish.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani stocks, hit by political unrest and a grim economic outlook, ended 2rm.</p>
<p>The Karachi 100-share index fell 33 points to end at 1,364.49. Losing scrips outnumbered gainers 184 to 52.</p>
</text>
